{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/500d741a9c49fa21cd573f479e91fd71.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/500d741a9c49fa21cd573f479e91fd71.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/500d741a9c49fa21cd573f479e91fd71.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your grandpa\u2019s farm and restore it to its former glory in <strong>Chiklet's Human Products</strong> that uniquely blends farming and survival. Begin your journey on a wild, overgrown island with only a few coins and the guidance of your grandpa\u2019s old buddy, Hacklet. As you explore, capture and harvest wild humans of all rarities, transforming them into a myriad of bizarre recipes that challenge conventional farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/a1bfc9da8481dc0fc3c92f41e44fb640.avif?t=1761418138\" width=426 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/21fa1f925b8ea9342e5db30253234aa9.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/21fa1f925b8ea9342e5db30253234aa9.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/21fa1f925b8ea9342e5db30253234aa9.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter not only feeble, wild humans but also formidable monsters as you venture into uncharted territories. Hone your combat skills and strategically upgrade your arsenal to overcome these threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/c13697fab9dbb7147c89a6a220297d76.avif?t=1761418138\" width=422 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/aea76dfce057c7cc41393949e95701b1.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/aea76dfce057c7cc41393949e95701b1.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/aea76dfce057c7cc41393949e95701b1.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and expand your farm to achieve unparalleled profits. Transition from manual labor to automated processes, and master the art of crafting unique human-based recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/5a78faaf5916c3ee15f34d861bd9906c.avif?t=1761418138\" width=417 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/cbe968e74035e580c4e0c5f9f528d8d4.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/cbe968e74035e580c4e0c5f9f528d8d4.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/cbe968e74035e580c4e0c5f9f528d8d4.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk or Ride your TukTuk cart throughout Homo Haven to hunt humans and monsters and gather resources. Upgrade your cart to automate the labor and improve logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/ec48ef5a52ce6c0d1e85234e27494ea6.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/ec48ef5a52ce6c0d1e85234e27494ea6.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/ec48ef5a52ce6c0d1e85234e27494ea6.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your Shovel, Fishing rod, Axe, PickAxe, Sword, Club, Sickle etc and embark on daring adventures across the wildest islands.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you revive your grandpa\u2019s legacy and defy the tyranny of a king obsessed with human life, or will the challenges of the islands prove too daunting? The choice is yours in this quirky, darkly humorous farming adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643250?t=1761418138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/a2bcbdb8a4334fd91e621ccd7b420e80b66f5a5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761418138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/e0ad53a019f432aa559300810e72af7b0d7b371c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761418138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/e0ad53a019f432aa559300810e72af7b0d7b371c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761418138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game depicts humans being chopped by animals in a comical, satirical way."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/500d741a9c49fa21cd573f479e91fd71.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/500d741a9c49fa21cd573f479e91fd71.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/500d741a9c49fa21cd573f479e91fd71.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your grandpa\u2019s farm and restore it to its former glory in <strong>Chiklet's Human Products</strong> that uniquely blends farming and survival. Begin your journey on a wild, overgrown island with only a few coins and the guidance of your grandpa\u2019s old buddy, Hacklet. As you explore, capture and harvest wild humans of all rarities, transforming them into a myriad of bizarre recipes that challenge conventional farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/a1bfc9da8481dc0fc3c92f41e44fb640.avif?t=1761418138\" width=426 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/21fa1f925b8ea9342e5db30253234aa9.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/21fa1f925b8ea9342e5db30253234aa9.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/21fa1f925b8ea9342e5db30253234aa9.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter not only feeble, wild humans but also formidable monsters as you venture into uncharted territories. Hone your combat skills and strategically upgrade your arsenal to overcome these threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/c13697fab9dbb7147c89a6a220297d76.avif?t=1761418138\" width=422 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/aea76dfce057c7cc41393949e95701b1.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/aea76dfce057c7cc41393949e95701b1.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/aea76dfce057c7cc41393949e95701b1.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and expand your farm to achieve unparalleled profits. Transition from manual labor to automated processes, and master the art of crafting unique human-based recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/5a78faaf5916c3ee15f34d861bd9906c.avif?t=1761418138\" width=417 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/cbe968e74035e580c4e0c5f9f528d8d4.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/cbe968e74035e580c4e0c5f9f528d8d4.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/cbe968e74035e580c4e0c5f9f528d8d4.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk or Ride your TukTuk cart throughout Homo Haven to hunt humans and monsters and gather resources. Upgrade your cart to automate the labor and improve logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/ec48ef5a52ce6c0d1e85234e27494ea6.poster.avif?t=1761418138\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/ec48ef5a52ce6c0d1e85234e27494ea6.webm?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/ec48ef5a52ce6c0d1e85234e27494ea6.mp4?t=1761418138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your Shovel, Fishing rod, Axe, PickAxe, Sword, Club, Sickle etc and embark on daring adventures across the wildest islands.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you revive your grandpa\u2019s legacy and defy the tyranny of a king obsessed with human life, or will the challenges of the islands prove too daunting? The choice is yours in this quirky, darkly humorous farming adventure!</p>","developers":["YK Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/5338274f05182f4b1336f435e128aefbc9aa0aa4/header.jpg?t=1761418138","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643250/620614793/e2a72bbc71f447305c59df402e6057be9083a027/1760430786/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760463776","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643250/620614793/e2a72bbc71f447305c59df402e6057be9083a027/1760430786/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760463776","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643250/620614793/e2a72bbc71f447305c59df402e6057be9083a027/1760430786/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760463776","id":257217605,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217605/movie480.mp4?t=1760463776","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217605/movie_max.mp4?t=1760463776"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257217605/1ada05b04fde37cf5a7bfa6f314a5d49a61f3c6f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760463776","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217605/movie480.webm?t=1760463776","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217605/movie_max.webm?t=1760463776"}}],"name":"Chiklet's Human Products","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX760 | AMD Radeon 7950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</st